WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.280 --> 00:00:05.080
It's become a military operation.

00:00:05.080 --> 00:00:11.740
German soldiers called in to help Berchtesgaden
- where a state of emergency has been declared.

00:00:11.740 --> 00:00:16.000
The Bavarian town hasn't seen snow like this
for years.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:21.000
And the dangers are all too real.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:23.860
We have many requests to help clear the roofs
of buildings.

00:00:23.860 --> 00:00:27.670
In the town of Bad Reichenhall, 13 years ago,
almost around this exact time, 15 people died,

00:00:27.670 --> 00:00:30.170
many of them children, when a roof collapsed.

00:00:30.170 --> 00:00:35.710
It's important to keep a close eye on the
roofs and secure any that pose a danger.

00:00:35.710 --> 00:00:41.000
Heavy snowfall has completely cut off the
Southern German town of Jachenau.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:46.789
It may look like a perfect picture postcard,
but there are increasing concerns that food

00:00:46.789 --> 00:00:51.239
supplies are running low.

00:00:51.239 --> 00:00:56.559
In Switzerland, guests were lucky to survive
an avalanche that came crashing through their

00:00:56.559 --> 00:00:58.179
hotel.

00:00:58.179 --> 00:01:04.160
Photos on social media show the devastation
as the 300-metre avalanche swept into the

00:01:04.160 --> 00:01:10.650
building at the Schwargalp mountain pass injuring
three people.

00:01:10.650 --> 00:01:16.229
In the mountains around Innsbruck in Austria,
they too are on Avalanche stand-by.

00:01:16.229 --> 00:01:24.100
There are concerns that if the weather improves,
people may take unnecessary risks.

00:01:24.100 --> 00:01:28.930
The fear is that people will say, well there
is a lot of snow the weather is better.

00:01:28.930 --> 00:01:33.359
And our experience from the last 30 years
has shown that the first day of improved weather

00:01:33.359 --> 00:01:40.789
is really dangerous, it`s when most avalanche
accidents happen.

00:01:40.789 --> 00:01:45.039
More than four metres of snow has already
fallen in this region.

00:01:45.039 --> 00:02:00.890
For those living here, the hard work looks
set to

00:02:00.890 --> 00:03:18.160
last sometime.

